{"lemma":"שְׁלֹמֹה","translit":"she.lo.moh","gloss":"Solomon","tbesh_subentries":[],"tbesh_html":"A king of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.5.14; <br> son of: David (H1732) and Bathsheba (H1339); <br> brother of: Shammua (H8051H), Shobab (H7727) and Nathan (H5416); <br> half-brother of: Amnon (H0550), Chileab (H3609), Absalom (H0053), Adonijah (H0138), Shephatiah (H8203), Ithream (H3507), Ibhar (H2984), Elishua (H0474), Nepheg (H5298H), Japhia (H3309I), Elishama (H0476H), Eliada (H0450), Eliphelet (H0467), Tamar (H8559H), Elpelet (H0467I), Nogah (H5052) and Jerimoth (H3406N); married to daughter_of_Pharaoh (H6547P) and Naamah (H5279A); <br> father of: Taphath (H2955), Basemath (H1315) and Rehoboam (H7346); also called Jedidiah at 2Sa.12.25;  <BR> § Solomon = \"peace\"<br> son of David by Bathsheba and 3rd king of Israel; author of Proverbs and Song of Songs<br>","tbesh_key":"H8010","strongs_1890":{"strongs_def":"Shelomah, David's successor","derivation":"from H7965 (שָׁלוֹם); peaceful;","kjv_def":"Solomon."},"count":293,"occurrences":[["2Sa.5.14",1,null,null],["2Sa.12.24",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.10",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.11",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.12",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.13",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.17",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.19",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.21",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.26",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.30",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.33",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.34",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.37",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.38",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.39",2,null,null],["1Ki.1.43",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.46",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.47",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.50",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.51",3,null,null],["1Ki.1.52",1,null,null],["1Ki.1.53",3,null,null],["1Ki.2.1",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.12",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.13",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.17",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.19",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.22",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.23",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.25",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.27",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.29",2,null,null],["1Ki.2.41",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.45",1,null,null],["1Ki.2.46",1,null,null],